1
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,880
Directional drilling is used to install
conduits under obstacles such as

2
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,320
roads, buildings and wetlands.

3
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,780
As demonstrated in this video,
conduits such as water,

4
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:18,920
sewer, fiber, electric and gas can be
installed under very busy intersections

5
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:21,720
without disruption of traffic.

6
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:25,660
A small area is needed to set up
