31
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:57,120
The bore path is typically enlarged to
one and a half size the conduit that is

32
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,700
being installed.

33
00:01:58,780 --> 00:02:02,820
In this installation, the bore path
has to be enlarged to accommodate the

34
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:07,160
conduit and a reamer is attached
to cut a larger diameter hole.

35
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:11,040
The reamer is simply pulled through
the existing bore path to enlarge the

36
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,120
hole.

37
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:17,380
As depicted in this video and as with
most directional drilling projects,

38
00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:21,480
very little of the normal city activities
