39
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,020
installation.

40
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:28,200
After the bore path is enlarged, the
conduit is simply pulled into place by

41
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,200
the directional drill rig.

42
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:35,040
This method of installing utilities
has many benefits that include less

43
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:39,920
disruption of commercial activities,
less disruption of traffic,

44
